# S8-2a (QUALIFICATION, first): the S3a matrix gate at EIGHT users on the AUDITED gate profile c2-packed-tp4-8-gate: eight users at 4,096 / 8,192 /
# 16,384 / 24,576 / 32,768 / 49,152 / 60,000 / 120,000 prompt tokens, 512 out, every arm IDENTICAL to its solo run (first run and one rerun, the
# policy's). Users 0 to 3 are block A, users 4 to 7 block B, so the matrix proves concurrent == solo across segment assignment in BOTH blocks.
# READ the report: POLICY PASS, 8 of 8 concurrent identical to solo, no refuse_round, no idle commit, no audit mismatch, no stall-watch dump, the
# arms' profile line c2-packed-tp4-8-gate, rounds read at live = 8 (the gate's c2_gate_live_n record), the per-block trace split.
# Duration (estimate): 100-180 min, the policy's worst case (a rerun) up to the step budget. Stop rule: any non-identical arm stops the window.
# SHIP WINDOW: bar: 8 of 8 concurrent arms identical to solo (strict), one rerun allowed by the policy.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8 SHIP window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's stop rule, its minutes and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8 is the SHIPPING image: the base SB8 builds
# from this branch with the eight-seat profile baked in as its serving default (ENV QWEN_C2_PROFILE) and the platform session cap baked as its
# seat count (ENV THATCH_SERVING_SESSION_CAP). Every job serves that one image, so the bytes that pass are the bytes that ship. Each job still
# names its profile explicitly, so none relies on the baked default. A commit that changes a file the image carries needs a new SB8 build and a
# new tag in every template.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-8
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,8192,16384,24576,32768,49152,60000,120000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=512
C2_GATE_JIT=record
